      "title": "About Ukraine Conflict",
      "subject": "Ukraine Conflict",
      "summary": "The Ukraine conflict is an armed conflict that began with Russia’s 2014 seizure of Crimea and fighting in eastern Ukraine, then expanded into a full-scale Russian armed attack across Ukraine on 24 February 2022. It includes frontline combat, long-range missile and drone strikes, attacks affecting civilian infrastructure, displacement, and international legal and diplomatic efforts to end the war and establish accountability.",
      "facts": [
