          "label": "Conflict timeline",
          "value": "The UN Human Rights Monitoring Mission in Ukraine has operated since 2014; it identifies 24 February 2022 as the start of the Russian Federation’s full-scale armed attack, after which it focused on the international armed conflict’s human-rights impact.",
