            "o1",
            "o2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Geographic scope",
          "value": "The war affects territory across Ukraine, including areas near the frontline, cities far from it, and territory occupied by the Russian Federation; Kyiv is among the urban centres affected by long-range attacks.",
