            "o3",
            "o4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Civilian-harm pattern",
          "value": "UN monitors reported that long-range weapons, including missiles and drones, were the leading cause of civilian casualties in June 2026, with many casualties occurring in urban areas far from the frontline; short-range drones were a major danger in frontline areas.",
